  "claim": "The first solo art exhibition of the author of the book was in 1943. The book inspired a film. The film featured \"The Comet Song\".",
  "evidencia": "Page: Comet in Moominland. Sentence: Comet in Moominland (Swedish: \"Kometjakten\" / \"Mumintrollet på kometjakt\" / \"Kometen kommer\") is the second in Tove Jansson's series of Moomin books.\nPage: Tove Jansson. Sentence: Her first solo art exhibition was in 1943.\nPage: Moomins and the Comet Chase. Sentence: Moomins and the Comet Chase is a 2010 3D stop motion animated fantasy adventure comedy family film compiled from the \"Comet in Moominland\"-based episodes of the 1977–1982 \"The Moomins\" TV series animated at Se-ma-for in Poland, restored and re-soundtracked with multiple voice actors replacing the single narrator.\nPage: The Comet Song. Sentence: \"The Comet Song\" is a song by Icelandic artist Björk, written by herself and long-time friend and collaborator Sjón as the title theme of the 2010 movie \"Moomins and the Comet Chase\".",
