        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "5ab79903-419b-5931-9b21-0bbd12f547bc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tove Jansson, Björk, Sjón\n- Books: Comet in Moominland, Moomin books\n- Films: Moomins and the Comet Chase\n- TV series: The Moomins\n- Songs: The Comet Song\n- Organizations: Se-ma-for\n\nFacts:\n- Tove Jansson held her first solo art exhibition in 1943.\n- Comet in Moominland is the second book in Tove Jansson's Moomin books series.\n- The Moomins TV series was animated at Se-ma-for in Poland from 1977 to 1982.\n- Moomins and the Comet Chase is a 2010 3D stop-motion animated fantasy adventure comedy family film compiled from The Moomins episodes based on Comet in Moominland.\n- Moomins and the Comet Chase was restored and re-soundtracked with multiple voice actors replacing the single narrator.\n- The Comet Song is a song by Björk, written with Sjón as the title theme of the 2010 film Moomins and the Comet Chase.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
